    "solution": "\\(f(A) = A^2 - 5A\\). With \\(A = \\begin{bmatrix} 3 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 2 \\end{bmatrix}\\): \\(A^2 = \\begin{bmatrix} 8 & 5 \\\\ -5 & 3 \\end{bmatrix}\\) and \\(5A = \\begin{bmatrix} 15 & 5 \\\\ -5 & 10 \\end{bmatrix}\\), so \\(A^2 - 5A = \\begin{bmatrix} -7 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -7 \\end{bmatrix} = -7I\\). Hence (A)."
